<title>FRANCE: French CDR plans 1 bln Fr property loan divestment.</title>
<headline>French CDR plans 1 bln Fr property loan divestment.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's CDR, the holding company in charge of selling off assets of Credit Lyonnais bank, said on Thursday it had asked Bankers Trust to manage the divestment of a one-billion-franc property loans portfolio.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the procedure chosen was a tender of a similar kind used in previous operations with Bankers Trust.</p>
</text>
